<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the $365,000</p>
<p>Czech ATP tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>3-Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Fabrice Santoro</p>
<p>(France) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>4-Cedric Pioline (France) beat Emilio Alvarez (Spain) 6-3 6-7</p>
<p>(7-9) 6-1</p>
</text>
